@format 1
@id funnel.add-rule
@title Add funnel rule
@area Funnel
@entry input
@summary Add one filename or regular-expression rule to the ordered funnel rule list.
@flow TB
@related funnel.remove-rule, funnel.move-rule

@alias rules = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PFunnelRules

[input] Add-rule command <input>
- Receive the selected rule form from the add menu @ rules.PFunnelMenuShow(...)
> create

[create] Create rule row <process>
- Create the rule editor and attach remove and drag handlers @ rules.PFunnelRuleAdd(...)
- Append it, apply order numbers, and update the empty notice @ rules.PFunnelRuleAdd(...)
> result

[result] Rule added <output>
= One editable rule appears at the end of the ordered list.
